{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Social Butterfly"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about voluntary actions and promises or threats, you use the future with <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when you make a decision at the moment of speaking.</li>  <li>You use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> for future plans, and for predictions based on evidence in the present situation.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'll pack some leftovers for Luther. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is he going to do there? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's leaving in the next couple of days. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I have an interview at 10 tomorrow.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely<br><br>Remember to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br>  <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026</li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Would you like \u2026 ?</li><li>Can I get you \u2026 ?</li><li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li> <li>I guess that could ...</li> <li>That would be \u2026</li> <li>I would \u2026</li> <li>Don't mind if I do!</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you like me to share some of my tricks?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:  Perhaps \u2026 I would definitely get more chefs to reveal their secrets that way!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about people's behavior and personality."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le16ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "helping "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "serving; portion "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Luther had 3 helpings of poutine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "praise "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "compliment "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's high praise, if you ask me!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "curious "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eager to know something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I'm curious about everything!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nosy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "showing too much interest about other people's lives "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think you sound a bit nosy sometimes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wide-eyed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " having one's eyes wide open in amazement; naive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: People often think I'm wide-eyed and innocent!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "demeanor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "behavior"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: My wide-eyed demeanor gets me many interviews!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "convincing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "persuasive "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I guess you're extremely convincing, then."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fool "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to trick or deceive someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I let my wide-eyed demeanor fool everyone."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob10aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of three professions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about the personality you need to have to have a job in that profession."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 4 adjectives that would describe that profession."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Would you like to have one of these jobs?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the professions with your partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">profession\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 3\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 4\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text