text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do you know all this? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You know me, V. I'm a social butterfly! I'm always curious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I just think you sound a bit nosy sometimes ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Don't worry about that! I let my wide-eyed demeanor fool everyone.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I guess you're extremely convincing, then."}, {"time": "35000", "image": "engenn6le16ob10re2img08.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure. I get a lot of interviews that way! Would you like me to share some of my tricks?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Perhaps ... I would definitely get more chefs to reveal their secrets that way!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's very cunning. I like that!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Anyway, I'll pack some leftovers for Luther before he leaves.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll give them to him. I have an interview at 10 tomorrow."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}